# Agent instructions live on the private master branch only. The marketplace
# installs the whole clone of main, and a coding agent opened in the plugin
# directory would read a root AGENTS.md as its own instructions. Listed here
# so a checkout of main can keep an untracked copy without git offering it.
/AGENTS.md
